      "evidence": [
        {
          "work_id": "w-nanqishu",
          "book_id": "b-nanqishu-052",
          "chapter_id": "c-nanqishu-052-later-literature-complete",
          "source_id": "s-nanqishu-052-later-literature-complete-ws2371079",
          "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-052-later-literature-complete:p022",
          "quote": "　　慰祖解褐奉朝請。父喪不食鹽，母曰：「汝旣無兄弟，又未有子胤。毀不滅性，政當不進肴羞耳，如何絕鹽！吾今亦不食矣。」慰祖不得已從之。父梁州之資，家財千萬，散與宗族，漆器題爲日字，日字之器，流乎遠近。料得父時假貰文疏，謂族子紘曰：「彼有，自當見還；彼無，吾何言哉！」悉火焚之。",
          "subject_person_mention_id": "c-nanqishu-052-later-literature-complete:p022:m0002",
          "object_person_mention_id": "c-nanqishu-052-later-literature-complete:p022:m0016"
        }
      ],
      "status": "source_attested",
      "interpretation_note": "母在崔慰祖父喪後勸其飲食。",
      "reviewer": "Codex（AI代理）",
      "model": null,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "a-qi052-cuiweizu-agnatic-elder",
      "subject_person_id": "536_9u3_amc",
      "object_person_id": "tvq_7my_nqh",
      "predicate": "agnatic_cousin",
      "qualifiers": {
        "source_term": "從兄慧景",
        "lineage": "paternal"
      },
      "evidence": [
        {
          "work_id": "w-nanqishu",
          "book_id": "b-nanqishu-052",
          "chapter_id": "c-nanqishu-052-later-literature-complete",
          "source_id": "s-nanqishu-052-later-literature-complete-ws2371079",
          "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-052-later-literature-complete:p024",
          "quote": "　　爲始安王撫軍墨曹行參軍，轉刑獄，兼記室。遙光好棋，數召慰祖對戲，慰祖輙辭拙，非朔望不見也。建武中，詔舉士，從兄慧景舉慰祖及平原劉孝標，竝碩學。帝欲試以百里，慰祖辭不就。",
          "subject_person_mention_id": "c-nanqishu-052-later-literature-complete:p024:m0029",
          "object_person_mention_id": "c-nanqishu-052-later-literature-complete:p024:m0057"
        }
      ],
      "status": "source_attested",
      "interpretation_note": "本傳從兄原詞；慧景另有卷五十一傳。",
      "reviewer": "Codex（AI代理）",
      "model": null,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "a-qi052-cuiweizu-agnatic-younger",
      "subject_person_id": "536_9u3_amc",
      "object_person_id": "j1u_ka8_86e",
      "predicate": "agnatic_cousin",
      "qualifiers": {
        "source_term": "從弟緯",
        "lineage": "paternal"
      },
      "evidence": [
        {
          "work_id": "w-nanqishu",
          "book_id": "b-nanqishu-052",
          "chapter_id": "c-nanqishu-052-later-literature-complete",
          "source_id": "s-nanqishu-052-later-literature-complete-ws2371079",
          "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-052-later-literature-complete:p028",
          "quote": "　　慰祖著《海岱志》，起太公迄西晉人物，爲四十卷，半未成。臨卒，與從弟緯書云：「常欲更注遷、固二史，採史、漢所漏二百餘事，在廚簏，可檢寫之，以存大意。《海岱志》良未周悉，可寫數本，付護軍諸從事人一通，及友人任昉、徐夤、劉洋、裴揆。」又令「以棺親土，不須塼，勿設靈座」。時年三十五。",
          "subject_person_mention_id": "c-nanqishu-052-later-literature-complete:p028:m0002",
          "object_person_mention_id": "c-nanqishu-052-later-literature-complete:p028:m0035"
        }
      ],
      "status": "source_attested",
      "interpretation_note": "臨卒書予從弟。",
      "reviewer": "Codex（AI代理）",
      "model": null,
      "human_reviewed": false
    }
  ],
